1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,246
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,643 --> 00:00:11,859
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:11,903 --> 00:00:16,117
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,308 --> 00:00:20,328
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,666 --> 00:00:22,199
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,245 --> 00:00:24,733
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,799 --> 00:00:26,880
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:26,971 --> 00:00:28,757
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,424 --> 00:00:30,650
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,927 --> 00:00:33,321
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,687 --> 00:00:35,800
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:40,560
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:42,560
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,716 --> 00:00:47,043
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:47,043 --> 00:00:48,618
(Based on Hongshu.com's novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,618 --> 00:00:49,649
=Episode 5=

17
00:00:51,679 --> 00:00:52,399
My lady!

18
00:00:52,399 --> 00:00:54,079
Where are we going in such a hurry?

19
00:00:54,159 --> 00:00:55,280
Pack our things.

20
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:56,119
We're running away!

21
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:03,000
Sorry.

22
00:01:03,079 --> 00:01:03,880
Wrong door.

23
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:05,040
Xiao Lu.

24
00:01:05,719 --> 00:01:05,959
No.

25
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,519
I should

26
00:01:08,519 --> 00:01:10,519
call you Your Majesty now.

27
00:01:11,719 --> 00:01:12,840
He knows everything?

28
00:01:13,599 --> 00:01:14,480
His Majesty said

29
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:16,480
we've neglected you for too long.

30
00:01:16,879 --> 00:01:17,799
From today,

31
00:01:17,799 --> 00:01:19,480
two more guards will be stationed here

32
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:21,000
to keep you safe.

33
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:23,840
Keep me safe?

34
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:25,680
More like keep an eye on me.

35
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:27,000
My lady.

36
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,200
What do we do now?

37
00:01:30,959 --> 00:01:32,120
Tiger on the hill.

38
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:34,079
Stay off that hill.

39
00:01:35,439 --> 00:01:36,200
Your Majesty.

40
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:38,200
The Cold Palace arrangements are made.

41
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:39,719
Lady Lu tried to flee.

42
00:01:39,719 --> 00:01:41,239
I caught her trying to flee.

43
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:43,319
You saw this coming, Your Majesty.

44
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,480
Did she resist?

45
00:01:46,959 --> 00:01:47,760
No.

46
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:50,280
Her Majesty was
surprisingly cooperative.

47
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:57,159
Chancellor Lu's daughter is said

48
00:01:57,159 --> 00:01:58,640
to be learned and courteous,

49
00:01:58,879 --> 00:02:00,560
gentle and dignified.

50
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:02,920
A chili hanging from a big tree.

51
00:02:04,879 --> 00:02:05,879
A big tree.

52
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:07,599
A tiny chili.

53
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,759
Such a handsome face.

54
00:02:16,759 --> 00:02:17,759
It'd be a shame not to sleep with you.

55
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:20,000
I'm keeping you all night!

56
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:23,560
This gets more interesting by the day.

57
00:02:27,039 --> 00:02:27,639
Your Majesty.

58
00:02:27,639 --> 00:02:29,280
The Empress Dowager
invites you to dinner.

59
00:02:30,719 --> 00:02:31,879
To Ningxin Palace.

60
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:32,639
Yes, Your Majesty.

61
00:02:38,639 --> 00:02:39,800
Consort Yao

62
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:41,879
came to me again today,

63
00:02:42,159 --> 00:02:43,199
weeping

64
00:02:43,199 --> 00:02:46,400
that even after three months, you
still haven't spent a night with her.

65
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,280
I think

66
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:50,319
you should grant her that favor.

67
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:52,639
And Consort Lan, too.

68
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:54,159
Mother.

69
00:02:55,199 --> 00:02:57,280
Must you meddle in my bedchamber too?

70
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,039
Has the Cheng family

71
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:01,319
sent in another petition lately?

72
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:03,719
Are you

73
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,479
putting me in my place?

74
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:09,479
I wouldn't dare.

75
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:11,719
You defied the entire court

76
00:03:12,199 --> 00:03:13,439
to put me on the throne.

77
00:03:13,719 --> 00:03:14,919
Though not my birth mother,

78
00:03:14,919 --> 00:03:16,120
you've been more of a mother to me
than my own ever was.

79
00:03:16,639 --> 00:03:19,639
I'll never forget what
you've done for me.

80
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:21,080
But

81
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:23,240
from the inner palace to the court,

82
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:24,919
you meddle in everything

83
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,879
and plant spies everywhere.

84
00:03:27,599 --> 00:03:29,319
It's been a constant source of trouble.

85
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:33,240
You chose to place
the imperial seal in my hands.

86
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,240
You should trust

87
00:03:35,599 --> 00:03:37,960
that I can keep

88
00:03:40,759 --> 00:03:41,879
my court firmly in hand.

89
00:03:42,159 --> 00:03:44,000
It is not your private garden.

90
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:48,280
I take my leave.

91
00:03:48,759 --> 00:03:51,159
Take good care of yourself, Mother.

92
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:04,840
(Cold Palace)

93
00:04:04,879 --> 00:04:06,639
Ah!

94
00:04:07,599 --> 00:04:10,000
The air is so fresh!

95
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,319
My lady!

96
00:04:11,319 --> 00:04:12,520
You're finally awake.

97
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:13,759
You slept for three days.

98
00:04:13,759 --> 00:04:15,400
I thought you were ill.

99
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,920
(I wasn't sleeping.)

100
00:04:16,959 --> 00:04:20,000
(I was developing new crops
in my Virtual Farm.)

101
00:04:21,079 --> 00:04:22,319
These grapes

102
00:04:22,319 --> 00:04:24,160
can make both juice and wine.

103
00:04:26,319 --> 00:04:28,680
Fine grape wine in a luminous jade cup.

104
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:32,560
The nobles will go wild for it.

105
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:34,690
(Wine)

106
00:04:36,199 --> 00:04:37,040
Try it.

107
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:40,000
Our very own Cold Palace grape wine.

108
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:42,439
One sip will put you in a good mood.

109
00:04:51,759 --> 00:04:52,680
This taste...

110
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:54,560
I've never had

111
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:56,040
anything so delicious.

112
00:04:57,639 --> 00:04:58,480
Too bad

113
00:04:58,800 --> 00:04:59,720
we have no ice.

114
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,480
In this heat,

115
00:05:03,079 --> 00:05:04,560
if we could serve it chilled,

116
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,720
it'd sell even better.

117
00:05:06,279 --> 00:05:08,800
Ice is scarce in summer.

118
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:11,480
Even the Empress Dowager and His Majesty
can barely get enough.

119
00:05:13,879 --> 00:05:15,480
If only we had saltpeter.

120
00:05:17,639 --> 00:05:18,680
(When I get a chance,)

121
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:21,160
(I'll take my two free workers
up the hill to look.)

122
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:23,639
Yinshuang.

123
00:05:23,639 --> 00:05:24,519
Go on. Get back to what you were doing.

124
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:29,800
Gentlemen.

125
00:05:30,959 --> 00:05:32,160
You must be tired.

126
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,000
Here, here.

127
00:05:33,439 --> 00:05:34,199
Cool off.

128
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:35,519
Thank you.

129
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,920
I made this grape wine myself.

130
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:38,279
Wait.

131
00:05:38,879 --> 00:05:39,959
Are you that trusting?

132
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:41,439
(Guard Jia)
What if there's something in the wine?

133
00:05:41,520 --> 00:05:43,346
(Guard Yi)

134
00:05:43,399 --> 00:05:45,040
Her Majesty doesn't seem like that.

135
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:47,319
We've had plenty of produce
from the back garden lately.

136
00:05:47,319 --> 00:05:49,160
She even gave us shelter from the rain.

137
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:52,480
Forgive me.

138
00:05:52,879 --> 00:05:54,839
I misjudged your good intentions.

139
00:05:54,839 --> 00:05:55,639
It's all right.

140
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:57,759
We're all friends now.

141
00:06:04,199 --> 00:06:05,879
This wine is so sweet and refreshing.

142
00:06:06,079 --> 00:06:06,839
See?

143
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:08,680
In this awful heat,

144
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:10,000
why would I try to hurt you?

145
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:19,839
Excellent wine!

146
00:06:19,959 --> 00:06:21,279
It's my secret recipe.

147
00:06:23,839 --> 00:06:25,279
If it were chilled,

148
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:27,040
it would taste even better.

149
00:06:27,839 --> 00:06:29,240
Do you need ice, Your Majesty?

150
00:06:29,439 --> 00:06:30,279
I can help.

151
00:06:33,839 --> 00:06:34,720
Your Majesty.

152
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:36,079
Ice isn't easy to come by.

153
00:06:36,079 --> 00:06:37,800
The Imperial Household
Office logs every block.

154
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:38,639
Don't worry.

155
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:40,600
I know how to make ice.

156
00:06:40,639 --> 00:06:41,439
Right now,

157
00:06:41,439 --> 00:06:42,879
I'm just missing a few ingredients.

158
00:06:43,199 --> 00:06:45,600
Come with me to the hill
behind the palace tomorrow.

159
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:50,199
Greetings, Your Majesty.

160
00:06:57,839 --> 00:06:59,360
I've been away only a few days,

161
00:07:00,079 --> 00:07:02,600
and you've already won over my men.

162
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:04,399
Lu Yunluo.

163
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:06,240
You certainly know
how to win people over.

164
00:07:09,759 --> 00:07:10,519
Well?

165
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:13,240
Surprised to see me?

166
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:17,160
I certainly am.

167
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,519
First a stranger on the roof,

168
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:22,120
then Prince Chen.

169
00:07:23,319 --> 00:07:24,079
Your Majesty,

170
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:26,040
how many identities do you have?

171
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:29,639
I could ask you the same.

172
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:32,120
A eunuch,

173
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,000
a maid,

174
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:33,879
the Empress.

175
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:36,959
Which is the real you?

176
00:07:38,519 --> 00:07:40,040
Brewing wine in secret,

177
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:41,319
bribing my guards.

178
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:42,600
Lu Yunluo.

179
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:44,680
Is life in the Cold Palace

180
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,279
too peaceful for your liking?

181
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:49,160
You've had plenty of my lotus wine.

182
00:07:50,639 --> 00:07:52,319
Your Majesty, are you jealous?

183
00:07:52,959 --> 00:07:53,560
You!

184
00:07:54,319 --> 00:07:55,279
You really are!

185
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,240
I...

186
00:08:00,399 --> 00:08:01,639
If you're jealous,

187
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:02,759
just say so.

188
00:08:04,399 --> 00:08:05,279
Ridiculous!

189
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,519
Why would I ever be jealous of you?

190
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:09,920
Then why

191
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:12,240
come straight to me after your illness?

192
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:13,639
Why have me watched?

193
00:08:13,959 --> 00:08:14,959
Afraid I'll run away?

194
00:08:15,279 --> 00:08:17,839
I remember what you promised me.

195
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:22,000
What if I said

196
00:08:22,279 --> 00:08:24,519
I could keep you in comfort
for the rest of your life?

197
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:33,039
Have you fallen for me?

198
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,200
What if I have?

199
00:08:36,159 --> 00:08:37,200
Little maid from the Cold Palace,

200
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:40,559
will you stay by my side?

201
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:50,120
I didn't know who you were then.

202
00:08:52,039 --> 00:08:52,960
You've touched me.

203
00:08:53,039 --> 00:08:53,960
We've shared a bed.

204
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,039
Does that matter?

205
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,919
Yet you still want to leave?

206
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:58,519
Once an empress,

207
00:08:58,799 --> 00:08:59,720
always an empress.

208
00:09:00,279 --> 00:09:01,399
Do you think you can escape?

209
00:09:02,159 --> 00:09:03,120
Emperor or not,

210
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:06,000
you killed my family on our wedding day.

211
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,720
You locked me in the Cold Palace.

212
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:09,440
Now you won't leave me alone.

213
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:12,840
(There's more to the Lu family's case.)

214
00:09:13,799 --> 00:09:15,360
(I'm protecting you too.)

215
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:20,799
It's not what you think.

216
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,799
Once everything is settled,

217
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,720
I will tell you.

218
00:09:25,559 --> 00:09:26,679
How can I make it up to you?

219
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,200
Anything except leaving the palace.

220
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:29,879
I'll grant it.

221
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:41,159
I want...

222
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,960
Why does this look so familiar?

223
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:54,559
You dared sell an imperial gift.

224
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:57,000
You have quite the nerve.

225
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:58,679
By the way, my lady,

226
00:09:58,960 --> 00:10:01,000
I've found a way to sell the pendant.

227
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,000
Is it safe?

228
00:10:02,519 --> 00:10:04,480
Eunuch Cheng, the kitchen buyer.

229
00:10:05,759 --> 00:10:07,080
Eunuch Cheng... Is he...

230
00:10:07,519 --> 00:10:08,240
Don't worry.

231
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:11,279
I'm not some bloodthirsty tyrant.

232
00:10:12,559 --> 00:10:13,639
That's a relief.

233
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:15,320
Have you decided what you want?

234
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,559
(An imperial gift...)

235
00:10:16,559 --> 00:10:17,320
(I can't sell it)

236
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,080
(or spend it.)

237
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:19,399
(I'll ask for something useful.)

238
00:10:20,279 --> 00:10:21,240
How gracious of you, Your Majesty.

239
00:10:21,639 --> 00:10:22,440
Ever since

240
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:24,039
I was a little girl, I've dreamed of...

241
00:10:24,399 --> 00:10:25,840
Get to the point.

242
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:29,639
I want my confinement lifted.

243
00:10:29,919 --> 00:10:31,519
I want to open a shop
in the Cold Palace.

244
00:10:55,230 --> 00:10:59,256
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

245
00:10:59,653 --> 00:11:03,869
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

246
00:11:03,913 --> 00:11:08,127
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

247
00:11:08,318 --> 00:11:12,338
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

248
00:11:12,676 --> 00:11:16,743
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

249
00:11:16,809 --> 00:11:20,990
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

250
00:11:21,434 --> 00:11:24,801
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

251
00:11:25,272 --> 00:11:29,952
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

252
00:11:31,609 --> 00:11:33,756
♪No finery to rival spring♪

253
00:11:33,936 --> 00:11:38,240
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

254
00:11:40,650 --> 00:11:42,396
♪Where is beauty found?♪

255
00:11:42,577 --> 00:11:47,007
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

256
00:11:47,574 --> 00:11:49,141
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

257
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:51,629
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

258
00:11:51,695 --> 00:11:53,776
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

259
00:11:53,940 --> 00:11:55,714
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

260
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:57,586
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

261
00:11:57,823 --> 00:12:00,217
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

262
00:12:00,458 --> 00:12:02,758
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

263
00:12:03,036 --> 00:12:07,360
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
